    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "description": {
      "en": "Lamp socket adapters and bulb-base converters built around the real base standards. Edison screw bases E26 (26.05 mm, 7-TPI Edison) and E27 (26.4 mm) are modelled as functional helical threads; twist-lock bases GU10 (two pins, 10 mm span) and B22 bayonet as real pins. Build a male screw shell, an E26↔E27 base converter, or a bayonet twist-lock base.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Adaptadores de casquillo y convertidores de base de bombilla construidos alrededor de los estándares reales. Las bases de rosca Edison E26 (26.05 mm, 7-TPI) y E27 (26.4 mm) se modelan como roscas helicoidales funcionales; las bases de bayoneta GU10 (dos pines, 10 mm) y B22 con pines reales. Genera un casquillo de rosca macho, un convertidor E26↔E27, o una base de bayoneta.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/socket-adapter.webp",
    "tags": ["lighting", "bulb", "socket", "edison", "e26", "e27", "gu10", "bayonet", "thread", "household", "hyperobject", "commons"],
